    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>26级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +21</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 39，''强韧'' 38，''反射'' 39，''意志'' 37</span><span>''侦查'' +16</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 15 毒素</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+31vs.AC<br>命中：17 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/close}}蛇群（毒素）</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该泽希尔的蜕皮的生命值降到 0。<br>攻击（无动作）：近程爆发 1（爆发内所有敌人）+30vs.强韧命中：10 点伤害，以及 15 点持续毒素伤害（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 22（+19）</span><span>''敏捷'' 22（+19）</span><span>''感知'' 17（+16）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 17（+16）</span><span>''智力'' 3（+9）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+13）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span></div></div>\n</div>",
